  "translation": "Yesterday afternoon, I set out from home to go to the supermarket. There were many people in the supermarket. I first entered the fruit section. There were apples, bananas, and grapes, and they were all very fresh. I bought three jin of apples and a bunch of grapes. Then I went to the drink section, took a cup of yogurt, and also bought a piece of bread. At the checkout, I met my friend Xiao Wang. He told me that he was not very busy. We decided to go home together. On the way, we bought two pieces of ice cream. The weather is very hot today, eating ice cream is really comfortable. We hadn't walked far before we arrived home. I asked him if we could meet again tomorrow. He said yes."
